IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0005.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CLM0005C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-SIU             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 CS-CD              PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-AUTO-REPORT
    PERFORM 3100-CLAIM-FREQ
    DISPLAY "WS-SIU=" WS-SIU
    DISPLAY "CS-CD=" CS-CD
    STOP RUN.
3000-AUTO-REPORT.
    IF L-TY = 'A' AND P-RP = 'N' AND WS-CLAM > 10000.00
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
        MOVE 'I' TO CS-CD
    END-IF.
3100-CLAIM-FREQ.
    IF P-CC >= 3
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
    END-IF.
